{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shadow of Juarez</strong> is a top-down 2D wave-shooter focused on high-intensity combat and progression-driven gameplay. Engage in fast-paced encounters against relentlessly spawning hostile forces, utilizing a wide arsenal of weapons and gear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through 20 upgradeable stats, and an in-depth XP, level and rank system. Unlock 20+ achievements, discover 15+ unique weapons, and deploy utilities such as grenades and proximity mines to maximize the amount of loot every wave.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4133840?t=1761821857","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133840/7ed10e71fa9fa130a1eb2a4fb59f956483a56ac4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761821857","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133840/cadf33593e5134d7bdb090ebcc17ec7b3b703ebf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761821857","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133840/cadf33593e5134d7bdb090ebcc17ec7b3b703ebf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761821857","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Shadow of Juarez contains heavy amounts of unrealistic blood upon killing an enemy. Blood/Gore can be disabled in the game settings."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shadow of Juarez</strong> is a top-down 2D wave-shooter focused on high-intensity combat and progression-driven gameplay. Engage in fast-paced encounters against relentlessl